{"id":"de8a2a5170e43df9","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-ordinal-analysis.md","title":"Ordinal Analysis","display":"df-ordinal-analysis — Ordinal Analysis","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-ordinal-analysis","aliases":["72-df-ordinal-analysis"],"display":"df-ordinal-analysis — Ordinal Analysis","depends_on":["[[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §1.4, print230–231/PDF242–243; local supremum lemma","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-ordinal-analysis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-ordinal-analysis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordinal-analysis — Ordinal Analysis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fd52635f93837cdf\" href=\"?note=fd52635f93837cdf\" title=\"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal\">72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §1.4, print230–231/PDF242–243; local supremum lemma"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-ordinal-analysis-—-OrdinalAnalysis\">df-ordinal-analysis — OrdinalAnalysis</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal W_T\">\\(\\mathcal W_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o(e)\">\\(o(e)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|T|\">\\(|T|\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd52635f93837cdf\" href=\"?note=fd52635f93837cdf\" title=\"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal\">72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>。下式的序数比较在ZFC元理论中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_2\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)\">\\(T\\vdash_2\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)\\)</span> 在固定对象演算中。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Lower}(T,\\alpha)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ \\exists e\\in\\mathcal W_T\\ (\\beta&lt;o(e)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Upper}(T,\\alpha)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in\\mathcal W_T\\ (o(e)\\le\\alpha),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OrdAnalysis}(T,\\alpha)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Lower}(T,\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{Upper}(T,\\alpha),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OrdAnalysis}(T,\\alpha)&amp;\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ |T|=\\alpha.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Lower}(T,\\alpha)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ \\exists e\\in\\mathcal W_T\\ (\\beta&lt;o(e)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Upper}(T,\\alpha)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in\\mathcal W_T\\ (o(e)\\le\\alpha),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OrdAnalysis}(T,\\alpha)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Lower}(T,\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{Upper}(T,\\alpha),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OrdAnalysis}(T,\\alpha)&amp;\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ |T|=\\alpha.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是序数分析的上下界证书目标，而不是把|T|=α放进Hypothesis后重新断言它。末式由上确界的最小上界性质直接推出：Lower给出α≤sup，Upper给出sup≤α；反向由sup定义。对于后继α，Lower强制有序型至少α的可证表示。实际序数分析还需要给出下界证明与上界归约；此定义没有把它们假定已经完成。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-ordinal-analysis-—-OrdinalAnalysis","text":"df-ordinal-analysis — OrdinalAnalysis","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"fd52635f93837cdf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"fd52635f93837cdf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$、$\\mathcal W_T$、$o(e)$ 与 $|T|$ 如 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]；$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$。下式的序数比较在ZFC元理论中，$T\\vdash_2\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)$ 在固定对象演算中。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal W_T","display":false},{"tex":"o(e)","display":false},{"tex":"|T|","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash_2\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Lower}(T,\\alpha)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\beta<\\alpha\\ \\exists e\\in\\mathcal W_T\\ (\\beta<o(e)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Upper}(T,\\alpha)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in\\mathcal W_T\\ (o(e)\\le\\alpha),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OrdAnalysis}(T,\\alpha)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Lower}(T,\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{Upper}(T,\\alpha),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OrdAnalysis}(T,\\alpha)&\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ |T|=\\alpha.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1633,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-237","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-ordinal-analysis|df-ordinal-analysis — Ordinal Analysis]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-235","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-ordinal-analysis — Ordinal Analysis](72-df-ordinal-analysis.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a21